      "message": "refactor(ui): the 2D and 3D pages draw through the form seam\n\nThe 2D family (2D milling, cutting and the editors they share) loses\nits raw egui calls: new seam helpers button_enabled,\nsmall_button_enabled, checkbox, list_row_truncated, note, drag_row and\ndrag_sized_row draw what the raw calls drew. The number and text fields\nthat move to drag_row, int_range_row and text_row now join the pane's\nTab / Enter ring and carry their row's accessible name.\n\nThe raw-call guard gets the 2D and 3D families at zero, and it counts a\ncall that is split after `ui` over two lines.\n\nStacked on the multi-axis slice (#4220): all change the guard rows.\n\nPinned by pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam,\nform_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families,\nthe_guard_counts_a_raw_call_split_over_two_lines and\nthe_2d_seam_helpers_keep_clicks_text_and_names.\n\nRefs #1122\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
